        "info_guide_why_eclaw_b6_desc": "Public capability ranking + live scores. Renters can pick the strongest; owners have proof. The whole market has credibility.",
        "info_slide_why_eclaw_b6_interview_arena_leaderboard_cta": "View Claude Design slide →",
        "info_guide_why_eclaw_b7_title": "Contract version-locking",
        "info_guide_why_eclaw_b7_desc": "9-state contract lifecycle. The listing config at rental start is snapshot-frozen. Owner edits later never affect in-flight contracts.",
        "info_slide_why_eclaw_b7_contract_version_locking_cta": "View Claude Design slide →",
